# i18n — generated files. zh.json/ko.json are committed, but the per-key source (file:line) index is
# excluded: it is large, and every source edit shifts line numbers and makes the diff churn.
# `npm run extract:i18n` regenerates it at any time (used during the B2 wiring and B3 translation).
/messages/zh.sources.json
